@host = http://localhost:9805


### 1. 初始化阶段
POST {{host}}/api/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2024-11-05",
    "capabilities": {
      "roots": {
        "listChanged": true
      },
      "sampling": {},
      "elicitation": {}
    },
    "clientInfo": {
      "name": "ExampleClient",
      "title": "Example Client Display Name",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  }
}



### 2. 调用阶段：执行具体工具
POST {{host}}/api/mcp
Mcp-Session-Id: 1b354619-a307-414c-a0df-2e57bfb84120
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "getWeather",
    "arguments": {
      "city": "北京"
    }
  },
  "id": 1
}
